ers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909660/extras/63ff0fc8c9ac934f85f8b687b5e57663.poster.avif?t=1747766363\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909660/extras/63ff0fc8c9ac934f85f8b687b5e57663.webm?t=1747766363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909660/extras/63ff0fc8c9ac934f85f8b687b5e57663.mp4?t=1747766363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
